Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:44.66,comments_v,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\pos(1662,801)\c&HFFFFFF&}自己仿製的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:42.00,comments_v,,0,0,0,,{\frz275.4\move(1233,102,861,156,21,230)}而且為什麼面向著這邊啦
